        dcterms:description "--self-test renders into tempfile.TemporaryDirectory() and skips the summary write (reproduced: morphoeval/runs/ mtime unchanged); default mode writes the summary JSON then media/ and docs/ PNGs" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L879-L889> .

    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-repro-package-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
